      "text": "double SKDistance(SKPoint3 a, SKPoint3 b) {\n    double dx = a.x - b.x, dy = a.y - b.y, dz = a.z - b.z;\n    return sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy + dz * dz);\n}",
